      "arabic": "١٢٢٥٢- أم مرثد الأسلمية «٦»\n: ويقال الغنوية.\nقال أبو عمر: أسلمت يوم الفتح، وبايعت النبيّ ﵌، روت عنها أمّ خارجة امرأة زيد بن ثابت.\nقلت: وقد تقدم حديثها في ترجمة أم حارثة.",
      "english": "12252—Umm Marthad al-Aslamiyya:⁶\n\nShe is also said to have been al-Ghanawiyya.\n\nAbu Umar said: She embraced Islam on the Day of the Conquest and pledged allegiance to the Prophet, may Allah bless him and grant him peace. Umm Kharija, the wife of Zayd ibn Thabit, transmitted from her.\n\nI say: Her hadith has already appeared in the entry on Umm Haritha.",
